      "name": "About Mirellis Immersive",
      "settings": {
        "hero_eyebrow": "RITUAL SCIENCE COMPANY",
        "hero_heading": "We study Human State Transitions.",
        "hero_body": "<p>Mirellis is a Ritual Science Company.</p><p>We study the moments between states — sleep and waking, work and recovery, stimulation and restoration — and build the rituals, sounds, and tools that help people navigate them.</p><p>Modern life removed the transitions that once regulated human beings. Continuous stimulation, fragmented attention, and compressed routines have changed how people focus, slow down, and recover.</p><p>The body still responds to repeated signals. The nervous system still learns through coherent sensory patterns. Mirellis exists to design those patterns.</p>",
        "hero_image": "shopify://shop_images/aboutus-mirellis.png",
        "rhythm_heading": "The body learns through repetition.",
        "rhythm_body": "<p>The central finding of our research is simple: the body responds to signals faster than instructions.</p><p>Willpower does not close the day. A coherent sensory signal does.</p><p>When the same ritual occurs at the same transition point repeatedly — the same scent, the same sound, the same moment — the nervous system begins to recognize it as a boundary marker. The transition becomes familiar. Eventually, it becomes automatic.</p><p>This is not wellness theory. It is how the nervous system actually works.</p>",
        "rhythm_image": "shopify://shop_images/rhythm-section-aboutus-mirellis.png",
        "ritual_heading": "Products are not the method.",
        "ritual_body": "<p>Sound is not the method. Articles are not the method.</p><p>The method is repeated, coherent sensory signaling — that teaches the nervous system where one chapter ends and the next begins.</p><p>Morning Clarity is the first signal of Sleep → Wakefulness. Stillness Elixir is the signal at Work → Recovery and Stimulation → Restoration. The sound environments are the acoustic layer of the same signal.</p><p>Used together, consistently, at the same transition points — they teach the body what comes next.</p>",
        "environment_image": "shopify://shop_images/environment-aboutus-mirellis.png",
        "restoration_heading": "Three transitions. Two tools. One method.",
        "restoration_body": "<p>Mirellis currently owns three Human State Transitions:</p><p>Sleep → Wakefulness — the first 30 minutes of the morning, before the phone arrives.</p><p>Work → Recovery — the moment the professional chapter needs to close, and the body needs to learn the day is done.</p><p>Stimulation → Restoration — the late evening, when the door out of the day has disappeared.</p><p>Every product, every sound environment, every Observatory finding maps to one of these three boundaries.</p>",
        "collab_heading": "Built through interdisciplinary collaboration.",
        "collab_body": "<p>Modern restoration touches many disciplines at once.</p><p>The way people feel is influenced not only by physiology, but also by environment, sensory experience, emotional pacing, repetition, light exposure, sound, atmosphere, behavior, and the rhythms surrounding daily life.</p><p>Mirellis is built through collaboration across formulation science, circadian health, Ayurveda, sensory research, sound design, behavioral understanding, and environmental psychology.</p>",
        "world_heading": "The Mirellis Observatory.",
        "world_intro": "The Observatory is the research arm of Mirellis. It publishes numbered Findings from our observation pool — durable, interpreted truths about Human State Transitions. Four findings published. More in progress.",
        "ending_eyebrow": "THE METHOD",
        "ending_heading": "Every observation becomes a finding. Every finding becomes an action. Every action improves a transition.",
        "ending_body": "Mirellis is a Ritual Science Company. We are at the beginning.",
        "ending_button": "Enter the Observatory",
        "ending_link": "/pages/the-observatory"
      }
    },
